<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Terms of Use – Carbon</title>
  <%- include('style') %>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="muted">Carbon Gym · Last updated: <%= lastUpdated %></p>

    <p>By creating an account or using the Carbon app, you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Keep your login details private; you are responsible for activity on your account.</li>
      <li>Give accurate information. You can update it in the app or ask the front desk.</li>
      <li>You can delete your account at any time from Profile → Delete account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Packages and payments</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Packages give access to training sessions and classes at Carbon gym locations, as described in the app.</li>
      <li>Prices are in Egyptian pounds (EGP) and are shown before you pay. Payments in the app are processed securely by
        Paymob.</li>
      <li>A package paid in the app starts on the payment date and is valid for the period shown on the package.</li>
      <li>Each check-in uses one session. Unused sessions expire at the end of the package's validity period.</li>
      <li>Refunds follow our <a href="/refunds">Refund Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Classes and check-in</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Class bookings depend on available spots. Please cancel bookings you can't attend.</li>
      <li>Check in by scanning the QR code at the front desk of the branch you are training at.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Use of the app</h2>
    <p>Don't misuse the app, try to access other members' information, or interfere with how it works. We may suspend
      accounts that do.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms; the date at the top shows the latest version.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? <% if (contactEmail) { %>Email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a> or<% } %>
      speak to the front desk at any Carbon branch.</p>

    <p class="muted"><a href="/refunds">Refund Policy</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/support">Support</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
